https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Original project: https://github.com/zzanehip/The-OldOS-Project

Changes made for OldCamera (standalone app, bug fixes, full-screen adaptation)
are described in README.md and EXTRACTION.json.

Bundled resources from The OldOS Project: the Camera artwork (Assets.xcassets) and the record tones (Resources/Sounds).
The capture service is derived from Camera-SwiftUI by Rolando Rodriguez, as bundled in OldOS.
